althy pre-restart state and boot identity were captured, restart was acknowledged, the post-restart boot identity changed, and service, content, private-path denial, firewall, system, and asset state recovered. Fixed lifecycle observations independently corroborate the boot transition and unchanged platform.","limitations":["HTTP behavior was tested from node1 using its managed-node address rather than from a separate external client; wildcard listening and runtime/permanent firewall observations provide supporting network-availability evidence."]}
